  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">British International Investment (BII) Mobilisation Facility (Non ICF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mobilisation Facility will support BII to increase its mobilisation of private finance into developing economies, enabling impact at even greater scale. The Facility will enable BII to explore a stronger &#x2018;originate-to-share&apos; approach, including increased co-financing, risk transfer and exiting assets earlier to the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
